('cr_037', 'criminalistics', 'Legal Medicine', 'What is the medico-legal officer?', '["Doctor who examines death cases", "Lawyer", "Police officer", "Judge"]'::jsonb, 0, 'easy', 'A medico-legal officer is a physician who investigates deaths for legal purposes.'),
