('cr_066', 'criminalistics', 'Forensic Ballistics', 'What is ballistics?', '["Study of firearms and projectiles", "Study of documents", "Study of fingerprints", "Study of blood"]'::jsonb, 0, 'easy', 'Ballistics is the science dealing with firearms and projectile behavior.'),
