('cr_080', 'criminalistics', 'Questioned Documents Examination', 'What are the natural variations in handwriting?', '["Normal differences in same person writing", "Forged signatures", "Printed text", "Typed documents"]'::jsonb, 0, 'hard', 'Natural variations are the normal, expected differences when the same person writes multiple times.'),
