('cdi_052', 'crime_detection', 'Fire Technology', 'What are the three elements of fire?', '["Heat, fuel, oxygen", "Water, earth, wind", "Light, dark, energy", "Red, orange, yellow"]'::jsonb, 0, 'easy', 'The fire triangle consists of heat, fuel, and oxygen - all needed for fire.'),
