('crm_042', 'criminology', 'Introduction to Criminology', 'Who is considered the father of criminology?', '["Cesare Lombroso", "Sigmund Freud", "Karl Marx", "Charles Darwin"]'::jsonb, 0, 'easy', 'Cesare Lombroso is considered the father of modern criminology.'),
